@host = http://localhost:3000

### Registro (el primero es admin)
POST {{host}}/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "123456" }

### Login
POST {{host}}/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "admin", "password": "123456" }

### Sin token → 401 (prueba en una ventana sin cookie)
GET {{host}}/resources

### Crear recurso (admin)
POST {{host}}/resources
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Sala B", "description": "Capacidad 4" }

### Crear reserva
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resourceId": 1, "start": "2026-12-01T10:00:00Z", "end": "2026-12-01T11:00:00Z" }

### Solapamiento → 409
POST {{host}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "resourceId": 1, "start": "2026-12-01T10:30:00Z", "end": "2026-12-01T11:30:00Z" }

### Modificar reserva
PUT {{host}}/bookings/1
Content-Type: application/json

{ "start": "2026-12-01T12:00:00Z", "end": "2026-12-01T13:00:00Z" }

### Notificaciones
GET {{host}}/notifications

### Cancelar reserva
DELETE {{host}}/bookings/1